1
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:42,890
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:45,990
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:55,220 --> 00:01:57,830
Xia Yingying left me two things.

4
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:01,330
The first is this hairpin.

5
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:04,680
The other is Qingrong.

6
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:07,200
After Xia Yingying passed away,

7
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,259
I was soft-hearted

8
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:10,910
and brought her back.

9
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,800
I raised her day and night.

10
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,960
We developed a bond,

11
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,970
and also an obsession.

12
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,430
In my heart,

13
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,630
Qingrong and Qingru

14
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:29,310
are both my own flesh and blood.

15
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,730
There is no difference.

16
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:34,560
You are so kind, Madam.

17
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,470
Maybe this is retribution.

18
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,130
I just hope Qingrong

19
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:52,120
will never know the truth.

20
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:12,990
[Harmony Among Kin]

21
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,910
You're here.

22
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,360
Third Sister, you're burning
the Rebirth Sutra

23
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,750
for Fifth Madam again.

24
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:24,360
Fortunately, the truth has come to light,

25
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,960
allowing the two of us

26
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:27,680
to peacefully coexist.

27
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:30,920
Previously, I saw you
as the daughter of my enemy,

28
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:35,390
but I didn't expect to have
hated the wrong person.

29
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:37,480
If it weren't for you,

30
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:41,090
the real culprit who killed
my mother and brother

31
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,660
would probably still be gloating today.

32
00:03:43,710 --> 00:03:44,400
But I...

33
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,400
Like you,

34
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,220
I lost my mother at a young age.

35
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:55,400
Therefore, in this residence,

36
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,120
the person who understands you best

37
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,850
should be me.

38
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:00,760
As your mother's child,

39
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:03,120
if you live under the same roof
as your enemy

40
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:05,310
and remain indifferent,

41
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:08,160
that'd make you truly unfilial

42
00:04:08,870 --> 00:04:09,730
and heartless.

43
00:04:12,430 --> 00:04:13,230
Third Sister,

44
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,800
I don't blame you,

45
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,010
and you shouldn't mind either.

46
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,720
I don't mind at all.

47
00:04:23,630 --> 00:04:24,040
Yes,

48
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,190
I did hate you before

49
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:29,070
and always made things difficult for you.

50
00:04:29,070 --> 00:04:30,730
But you didn't suffer either.

51
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,600
Anyway, every time I teased you,

52
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,540
I was the one who ended up unlucky.

53
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,360
Qingyuan,

54
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:46,470
I'm sorry.

55
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,450
And thank you, really.

56
00:04:58,630 --> 00:04:59,630
Mei Yinghua

57
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:02,480
received a heavy punishment from Father.

58
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,830
If Fifth Madam
knew this in the afterlife,

59
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:06,160
she could rest in peace.

60
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,690
But there's one thing I don't understand.

61
00:05:11,690 --> 00:05:14,130
[Harmony Among Kin]

62
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:14,600
Concubine Mei is not
proficient in pharmacology,

63
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:17,730
so how could she come up
with such a subtle poison scheme?

64
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,180
Or is it really as she said,

65
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,390
she only wanted Fifth Madam to miscarry

66
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,990
and had no intention to kill?

67
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:32,680
That cruel woman bullied my mother

68
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,040
and managed internal affairs for years.

69
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,240
Naturally, she had no good intentions.

70
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:39,310
Since childhood,

71
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:41,480
you grew up under Mother's roof

72
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:43,310
with Second Sister.

73
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:46,270
You always disregarded others.

74
00:05:47,310 --> 00:05:48,570
As such, you might have

75
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:51,430
overlooked certain things.

76
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:57,320
You've just recently discovered that

77
00:05:57,830 --> 00:06:00,060
the real murderer is not my mother,

78
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:01,360
but Mei Yinghua.

79
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,430
The Xie family

80
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,330
hides far too many secrets.

81
00:06:09,190 --> 00:06:10,120
What you hear

82
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,600
and see

83
00:06:12,310 --> 00:06:13,970
is not necessarily the truth.

84
00:06:14,430 --> 00:06:16,430
Even though Mei Yinghua is vicious,

85
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:17,680
she knew

86
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,510
she couldn't escape her crimes.

87
00:06:19,510 --> 00:06:21,570
So why did she bite back for no reason?

88
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:24,800
Why isn't anyone accusing her?

89
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,840
A-Are you out of your mind?

90
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:29,750
You told me about the euphorbia!

91
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:34,960
Though I no longer hate you,

92
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:37,690
I don't need to hear you say these things.

93
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,190
I've been in the residence
for a long time.

94
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,790
If there's really anything,

95
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,560
I'd know.

96
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:03,950
Lord Xie.

97
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:06,760
Having just lost your beloved son,

98
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,960
you still insist on stepping up
to take charge.

99
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:12,680
I admire you.

100
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:20,190
I will substitute tea for wine

101
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,260
to toast you, Lord Xie.

102
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,170
-To Lord Xie.
-To Lord Xie.

103
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,460
My trivial family matters

104
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:51,070
have troubled you, my lords.

105
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:54,390
Thank you.

106
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:58,310
Please.

107
00:07:58,870 --> 00:07:59,800
Please, my lord.

108
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,850
Yan Rui has left.

109
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,450
It is settled that Wei Changyan

110
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:15,350
colluded with

111
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,010
the northern bandits.

112
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,040
I would like to hear

113
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,190
what your next steps

114
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,310
will be.

115
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:28,270
Yan Rui is finally cleared out
of Hengtang.

116
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,510
Wei Changyan left behind a huge mess
of unresolved accounts.

117
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:35,600
We still need you
to make decisions, Lord Xie.

118
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,030
Not so.

119
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,320
Not so.

120
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:44,010
Hengtang belongs to all of you,

121
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:46,480
not just me.

122
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,240
In all matters,

123
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:51,600
we must join forces

124
00:08:51,910 --> 00:08:54,240
and deliberate together.

125
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,600
-Yes.
-Yes.

126
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,870
In my opinion,

127
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,930
we should follow the old rules.

128
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:06,390
The more you work, the more you gain.

129
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,440
What do you think?

130
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:09,720
Good.

131
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,050
Your Lordship is right.

132
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:12,910
Your Lordship is right.

133
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:14,630
Lord Xie,

134
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,790
with you in charge,

135
00:09:15,790 --> 00:09:17,960
we naturally have no objections.

136
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,630
Right, my lords?

137
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,720
That's right.

138
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,000
No objections at all.

139
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,480
Lord Xie,

140
00:09:23,030 --> 00:09:26,660
Wei Changyan
left a sum of money at the dock.

141
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:28,240
Counting it

142
00:09:28,390 --> 00:09:30,120
will take some effort.

143
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:33,270
I am willing to share your burden,
Lord Xie.

144
00:09:33,390 --> 00:09:35,460
Lord Xie, I'm also free lately.

145
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,670
I'm willing to help settle
Wei Changyan's old accounts too

146
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:39,120
and share your burden, Lord Xie.

147
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,090
I'm free too.

148
00:09:40,110 --> 00:09:40,750
I'm free too.

149
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:43,550
We are also willing
to share your burden, Lord Xie.

150
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:47,790
Whose people are they?

151
00:09:47,790 --> 00:09:48,600
This...

152
00:09:50,030 --> 00:09:50,600
This...

153
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,670
Death is at your door,

154
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,790
yet you are still fighting over
a few pieces of silver.

155
00:09:54,790 --> 00:09:55,390
This is...

156
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:56,630
Lord Xie,

157
00:09:57,010 --> 00:09:59,220
[Yongjia County Lady, Pei Yuting]

158
00:09:57,150 --> 00:09:59,750
you really know
how to lead your subordinates.

159
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:00,880
How dare you?

160
00:10:01,030 --> 00:10:02,000
Who are you?

161
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,360
My lords are discussing
important matters here.

162
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,220
How can a woman like you come here?

163
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:06,670
Guards!

164
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,360
Wait!

165
00:10:08,150 --> 00:10:10,240
If I'm not mistaken,

166
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,150
could you be

167
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:14,240
the adopted daughter
of the Imperial Noble Consort,

168
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,550
sister of Pei Liangyong,

169
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,750
Yongjia County Lady?

170
00:10:16,790 --> 00:10:17,600
County Lady?

171
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,750
Greetings, My Lady.

172
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:27,390
I, Pei Yuting, haven't been
in Hengtang for a long time,

173
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:28,850
but you still remember me.

174
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:29,960
It seems

175
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,240
you are not completely foolish.

176
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,080
We wouldn't dare.

177
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,320
Founding Countess

178
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:40,220
was involved in disaster relief efforts

179
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,870
and met with an accident.

180
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:44,840
I was deeply saddened.

181
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:48,670
Are you here regarding that matter?

182
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:51,870
I missed seeing off
my brother and sister-in-law.

183
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:52,790
But,

184
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:55,410
I'm just in time to see you all off.

185
00:10:56,690 --> 00:10:57,910
See us off?

186
00:10:57,910 --> 00:10:58,510
No...

187
00:10:59,390 --> 00:11:00,600
What do you mean?

188
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:05,270
I heard that with Lord Xie in Hengtang,

189
00:11:05,870 --> 00:11:08,530
our Pei family will always
be at a disadvantage.

190
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,330
If today,

191
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:12,750
Lord Xie is willing to beg me

192
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,320
and make me happy,

193
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:17,170
I might be willing to tell you something.

194
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:22,960
Please enlighten me.

195
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:26,870
The fake Yan Rui you let slip

196
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:30,620
is actually a favored minister
of His Majesty,

197
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,000
Shen Run.

198
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:37,870
Even the Prince
has to treat him with respect.

199
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:40,160
Do you know what's even more terrifying?

200
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:42,630
His father was Shen Zhibai.

201
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:44,790
This...

202
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:47,600
Now he has requested
an edict to return to Hengtang.

203
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,480
Tell me,

204
00:11:48,870 --> 00:11:49,840
if he met the lot of you

205
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:52,440
who framed his father,

206
00:11:52,670 --> 00:11:53,440
now that he is back,

207
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,120
how would he deal with you?

208
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,480
This... I...

209
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,280
Especially you, the Xie family.

210
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,540
Falling into his hands

211
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:04,150
is only a matter of time.

212
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:06,870
This...

213
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,130
How can I ensure my family's survival?

214
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:09,960
We're doomed.

215
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:10,840
A fake Yan Rui left,

216
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,240
and a real king of hell is coming.

217
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:13,360
What do we do now?

218
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,160
That's right.

219
00:12:14,550 --> 00:12:15,150
Lord Xie.

220
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:15,750
Lord Xie.

221
00:12:15,750 --> 00:12:17,000
You have to think of a way quickly.

222
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,360
-Lord Xie.
-Lord Xie.

223
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:20,890
-Do something.
-Protect my family, Lord Xie.

224
00:12:21,510 --> 00:12:23,630
Yes, Lord Xie, please say something.

225
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:28,360
Lord Xie,

226
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:31,320
are you really not afraid at all?

227
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:37,320
Lord Shen Zhibai

228
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:41,030
was a close friend of mine
when he was alive.

229
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:43,440
Since he is the son of an old friend,

230
00:12:44,030 --> 00:12:45,960
I can't wait to catch up with him.

231
00:12:46,670 --> 00:12:47,870
What is there to fear?

232
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,670
It seems

233
00:12:52,690 --> 00:12:54,960
Lord Xie has already found a way out.

234
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,540
What about the rest of you?

235
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:00,320
I'm afraid it won't be so easy for you.

236
00:13:01,310 --> 00:13:02,080
My Lady.

237
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:05,730
My wife also has
water transport gangs at the docks.

238
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:07,630
If you want them,

239
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:08,480
I will offer them all.

240
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,080
Please save my life.

241
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:10,870
My family has a dock.

242
00:13:10,870 --> 00:13:12,630
-I'll surrender it to the Pei family.
-Please protect us, My Lady.

243
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:13,960
-My Lady.
-Shoo, shoo!

244
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:15,550
We have granaries and rice barns!

245
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:16,150
They are all for the Pei family.

246
00:13:16,150 --> 00:13:16,600
Alright.

247
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:16,910
My Lady.

248
00:13:16,910 --> 00:13:17,480
Let go.

249
00:13:17,790 --> 00:13:18,250
My Lady.

250
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,660
I don't have the final say.

251
00:13:20,670 --> 00:13:22,460
You need Lord Xie's approval.

252
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:25,120
Lord Xie, please say something.

253
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,150
The Pei family

254
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:32,250
manages hundreds of water transport gangs.

255
00:13:32,630 --> 00:13:34,630
Back then, one of Lord Shen Zhibai's

256
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,270
major crimes

257
00:13:36,670 --> 00:13:39,720
was embezzling profits
from water transport.

258
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:43,000
Now that Shen Run is investigating things,

259
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:45,630
My Lady, although it has
nothing to do with you,

260
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:46,550
I'm afraid

261
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:50,150
the Pei family cannot escape involvement.

262
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,150
If I'm not wrong,

263
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:56,960
the Pei family is already caught
in Shen Run's schemes.

264
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:58,870
I suggest

265
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:03,530
the Pei family figure out a way
to protect yourselves soon.

266
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,480
I just said it.

267
00:14:07,290 --> 00:14:11,200
Hengtang belongs to everyone,

268
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:14,270
not just me.

269
00:14:15,150 --> 00:14:17,210
We can discuss everything together.

270
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,770
Besides,

271
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,660
the County Lady has returned.

272
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,250
She is wise, too.

273
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,360
I suggest letting

274
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:27,390
the County Lady take charge
of the overall situation.

275
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:28,750
You can all discuss together

276
00:14:28,750 --> 00:14:30,580
and do what you want best.

277
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,450
I will listen to you all.

278
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,360
Don't say that, Lord Xie.

279
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,890
Lord Xie, what should we do?

280
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:54,010
What year is this old tea from?
It's so bitter.

281
00:14:55,750 --> 00:14:56,670
Lord Xie,

282
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,870
it's time for something new.

283
00:15:12,150 --> 00:15:13,600
Okay.

284
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:17,440
[Distinguished Family]

285
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,960
What?

286
00:15:17,750 --> 00:15:18,910
Call off the engagement?

287
00:15:18,910 --> 00:15:19,600
Yes.

288
00:15:20,150 --> 00:15:20,960
Reporting to the Master

289
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,820
and Head Madam,

290
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,020
the Pei family says

291
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,000
the Eldest Lady

292
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,360
is cursed to harm her mother and husband,

293
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:28,020
so they sent a notice
to call off the engagement.

294
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:31,910
Pei Liangyong

295
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,930
is utterly ridiculous.

296
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,360
How can marriage

297
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:38,490
be treated as child's play?

298
00:15:38,550 --> 00:15:41,150
The three letters and six etiquettes
have all been completed.

299
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:43,550
He can't just call it off
whenever he wants.

300
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,900
Calm down, Master.

301
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,740
They just got engaged,

302
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,200
and Madam Pei died a tragic death.

303
00:15:50,510 --> 00:15:52,320
Presumably, the Founding Count

304
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:53,960
has other thoughts.

305
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,600
Maybe he thinks it's bad luck.

306
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,390
What did you say?

307
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,630
So unruly.

308
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:06,750
The heir of the Founding Count
is in mourning.

309
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,960
They certainly won't be able to marry

310
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,290
within the next 3 years.

311
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:14,320
But Qinghe can't wait that long.

312
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:17,570
Why don't we find her another family?

313
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:27,360
Father.

314
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,320
Lanshan and I have an agreement.

315
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,670
As soon as his mourning period is over,
we will get married.

316
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:33,530
I don't want to marry anyone else.

317
00:16:35,270 --> 00:16:36,240
Qinghe.

318
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,330
You are not yet married.

319
00:16:38,390 --> 00:16:39,840
Although you have an engagement,

320
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,140
meeting privately

321
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:43,410
will give people cause for gossip.

322
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:44,240
Exactly.

323
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,030
If this gets out one day,

324
00:16:46,030 --> 00:16:47,630
people will say the women
of the Xie family are unchaste,

325
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:48,960
and that's why the engagement was broken.

326
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,090
It'd really disgrace our family name.

327
00:16:57,790 --> 00:16:58,550
Mother.

328
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:01,000
This is just an excuse
the Pei family made up

329
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,660
to break the engagement.

330
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:04,240
Instead of seeking justice,

331
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:06,109
why are we blaming Eldest Sister?

332
00:17:09,349 --> 00:17:10,109
Father.

333
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:11,790
I think the Pei family

334
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,589
isn't targeting Eldest Sister,

335
00:17:13,589 --> 00:17:15,790
but trying to embarrass our Xie family.

336
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,720
Qinghe.

337
00:17:22,069 --> 00:17:24,130
You really have an unfortunate fate.

338
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:25,829
She should be punished if she deserves it.

339
00:17:25,829 --> 00:17:27,690
Don't let our inner court affairs

340
00:17:28,069 --> 00:17:30,440
ruin the friendship
between the two families.

341
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,310
Okay.

342
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:32,110
Stop talking.

343
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:33,950
Everyone, stop talking.

344
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:42,610
I am busy with official duties every day,

345
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:46,160
and I still have to listen
to your chattering when I get back.

346
00:17:46,310 --> 00:17:48,110
A minister's virtue is loyalty.

347
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,970
A son's virtue is filial piety.

348
00:17:50,110 --> 00:17:51,160
And a woman's virtue

349
00:17:51,160 --> 00:17:52,360
is her wifely duties.

350
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:56,480
I think you have all forgotten
them in this residence.

351
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,400
Each of you has your own ideas.

352
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,590
Wenzhuo,

353
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,400
don't let me worry about

354
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,400
the matters of the inner household.

355
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:09,770
You make the decisions.

356
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,960
If anyone dares to disobey,

357
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:15,490
punish them with family rules
without mercy.

358
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:18,000
Yes.

359
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,650
Eldest Lady Qinghe

360
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,200
has misbehaved

361
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,720
and damaged
the reputation of the Xie family.

362
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,250
She is grounded for 3 months

363
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,640
and must copy the Admonitions for Women

364
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,570
a hundred times.

365
00:18:44,270 --> 00:18:45,160
Qingyuan,

366
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:48,610
if you feel sorry for your eldest sister,

367
00:18:50,750 --> 00:18:54,160
kneel in the ancestral hall
with her tonight.

368
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,360
To think you wanted
Father to speak for you.

369
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,450
You should realize clearly

370
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:12,250
who is in charge of
the Xie's inner household

371
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:14,130
from now on.

372
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:32,440
Eldest Sister.

373
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:34,830
Fourth Sister.

374
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:36,720
I'm sorry.

375
00:19:37,270 --> 00:19:38,930
I dragged you into this again.

376
00:19:40,270 --> 00:19:41,530
Don't blame yourself.

377
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:42,830
Mother

378
00:19:42,830 --> 00:19:45,600
is angry that I asked
Third Madam about the past,

379
00:19:46,030 --> 00:19:47,790
so she deliberately targeted you.

380
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:49,650
It's me who dragged you into this.

381
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:54,110
What happened between you
and Young Master Pei?

382
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:55,270
The day before yesterday,

383
00:19:55,270 --> 00:19:57,930
didn't he come to the herbal shop
to look for you?

384
00:19:59,030 --> 00:20:00,310
I have no idea.

385
00:20:00,410 --> 00:20:02,890
[Respectful exchange of birth details]
[A match made in heaven]

386
00:20:00,830 --> 00:20:01,830
He clearly said

387
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:04,270
he would marry me in 3 years.

388
00:20:04,270 --> 00:20:05,830
But it's only been 3 days,

389
00:20:06,310 --> 00:20:08,040
and the narrative has changed.

390
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:11,510
Something must be wrong.

391
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,480
Don't worry.

392
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:17,270
Something might have happened
in the Pei family.

393
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:18,960
I will go to the Pei residence tomorrow

394
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:20,690
and get an explanation for you.

395
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:25,750
Madam.

396
00:20:26,510 --> 00:20:29,830
The Pei family sent someone to deliver
generous gifts today.

397
00:20:29,830 --> 00:20:31,750
They said Fourth Lady

398
00:20:32,030 --> 00:20:34,360
went to the Pei family for an explanation,

399
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:37,050
and they came to apologize to Eldest Lady.

400
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:41,270
It's Qingyuan causing trouble again.

401
00:20:42,790 --> 00:20:43,850
It doesn't matter.

402
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:49,170
Anyway, this marriage with
the Founding Count's residence is ruined.

403
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,510
Just keep Qinghe

404
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:52,350
locked up for now.

405
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,590
Let the third branch know

406
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,890
the rules of the Xie household.

407
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:59,030
Nothing else matters.

408
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,320
The most important thing

409
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:05,350
is Zhenglun's funeral.

410
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,590
Have you done

411
00:21:08,590 --> 00:21:09,720
everything needed?

412
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:12,080
Rest assured, Madam.

413
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:15,640
The belongings of Eldest Young Master
just arrived,

414
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:17,370
and I've already checked them.

415
00:21:17,590 --> 00:21:18,850
That item is not there.

416
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:21,830
That's good.

417
00:21:25,400 --> 00:21:26,440
My Lady.

418
00:21:27,030 --> 00:21:28,920
Madam Hu is really too vicious.

419
00:21:28,920 --> 00:21:30,200
Even though the Pei family has apologized,

420
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:32,200
she still won't let Eldest Lady out.

421
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:34,700
In this residence,

422
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:37,810
the deaths of Concubine Xia and my mother,

423
00:21:38,070 --> 00:21:39,670
and Concubine Mei going mad,

424
00:21:39,790 --> 00:21:41,830
were all her doing.

425
00:21:44,310 --> 00:21:45,240
Tomorrow

426
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,900
is Eldest Brother's funeral.

427
00:21:49,590 --> 00:21:51,480
It's time for the guilty

428
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,360
to be buried with him.

429
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:59,030
Lord Xie,

430
00:21:59,350 --> 00:22:00,090
my condolences.

431
00:22:00,090 --> 00:22:01,710
-Xie.
-Lord Xie, my condolences.

432
00:22:01,710 --> 00:22:02,430
My condolences.

433
00:22:02,430 --> 00:22:03,920
Xie, my condolences.

434
00:22:04,510 --> 00:22:06,500
Zhenglun died for his nation.

435
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:07,920
The men of Hengtang

436
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,350
will never forget this.

437
00:22:09,350 --> 00:22:11,080
My brother died for his nation.

438
00:22:11,270 --> 00:22:12,710
But at his funeral,

439
00:22:13,110 --> 00:22:15,400
even his body couldn't be sent home.

440
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,590
The Northern Frontier is far,

441
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:18,790
and the war is raging.

442
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:21,400
They could only gather his clothes

443
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:23,200
and send them back by fast horse.

444
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:26,810
Had I known it was a final farewell,

445
00:22:27,110 --> 00:22:28,790
I would have spoken to him

446
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,400
much more in the past.

447
00:22:32,350 --> 00:22:34,050
Chunzhi insisted on coming,

448
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:35,850
but he is really unwell.

449
00:22:35,870 --> 00:22:37,590
I didn't want him to bring any illness

450
00:22:37,590 --> 00:22:39,160
to disturb Zhenglun's spirit.

451
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,790
Thank you for your thoughtfulness,
Madam Li.

452
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:43,790
It is comforting enough that
the two of you could come.

453
00:22:45,590 --> 00:22:46,830
Ever since you arrived,

454
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:48,590
the Xie family has had no peace.

455
00:22:48,610 --> 00:22:50,470
Watch your words, Second Sister.

456
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,920
We're at Eldest Brother's funeral.

457
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:54,980
How can you say such baseless things?

458
00:22:55,890 --> 00:22:56,960
How is it baseless?

459
00:22:58,030 --> 00:22:58,960
Qingru,

460
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:00,750
stop making a scene.

461
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:10,070
Yongjia County Lady has arrived!

462
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,200
My Lady.

463
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:16,200
Apologies for not welcoming you.

464
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,730
Greetings, My Lady.

465
00:23:24,960 --> 00:23:25,880
Lord Xie.

466
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:28,070
It's getting late.

467
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:29,680
You should begin.

468
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:39,880
Master,

469
00:23:41,070 --> 00:23:42,960
shall we begin?

470
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,240
My Xie family

471
00:23:47,830 --> 00:23:49,720
is a family that upholds loyalty, valor,

472
00:23:49,720 --> 00:23:51,650
filial piety, and righteousness.

473
00:23:52,160 --> 00:23:53,680
My eldest son, Zhenglun,

474
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:56,170
dedicated himself to the nation,

475
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:58,200
protecting our land and our people.

476
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,840
In his final moments,

477
00:24:00,400 --> 00:24:01,880
he fought bravely against the enemy,

478
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:03,750
dyeing his battle robes with blood.

479
00:24:03,750 --> 00:24:04,790
He has brought

480
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:07,680
honor to the ancestors of the Xie family.

481
00:24:08,000 --> 00:24:08,720
Today,

482
00:24:08,830 --> 00:24:10,640
I lead the entire Xie family

483
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:13,590
to respectfully welcome
the general's armor

484
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:14,440
back home.

485
00:24:16,640 --> 00:24:19,240
The general's armor
is returning for burial!

486
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:06,750
There seems to be

487
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,640
a letter within the armor.

488
00:25:08,520 --> 00:25:10,020
[Respectfully to Brother Zhenglun,
from younger brother Zhengjun]

489
00:25:13,590 --> 00:25:15,520
Did this belong to Eldest Brother?

490
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:17,440
Since it was his belonging,

491
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:19,500
let's burn it together for Zhenglun.

492
00:25:19,790 --> 00:25:20,480
Nanny Liu.

493
00:25:20,500 --> 00:25:21,090
Yes.

494
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:23,030
No!

495
00:25:23,030 --> 00:25:23,760
Out of my way!

496
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:27,760
I want to know what my brother said
before he died.

497
00:25:28,750 --> 00:25:29,850
This letter

498
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:31,660
appearing here suddenly

499
00:25:31,830 --> 00:25:32,830
must mean that Eldest Brother

500
00:25:32,830 --> 00:25:34,830
still has some unfulfilled wishes.

501
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:40,110
Thank you both.

502
00:25:40,790 --> 00:25:42,650
It's our duty to avenge the heroic

503
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,400
and redress any grievances.

504
00:25:45,030 --> 00:25:45,510
Go.

505
00:25:46,030 --> 00:25:47,200
Expose that evil woman's true colors

506
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:48,730
in front of all of Hengtang.

507
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,580
We will support you from here.

508
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:51,830
There is one more thing

509
00:25:51,830 --> 00:25:53,030
I need your help with.

510
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,200
Tell us.

511
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:57,070
At my eldest brother's funeral tomorrow,

512
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:57,920
this letter

513
00:25:58,240 --> 00:26:00,270
must appear among his belongings.

514
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,640
Leave it to us.

515
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:10,500
[Respectfully to Brother Zhenglun,
from younger brother Zhengjun]

516
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:49,070
Zhengjun.

517
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:51,480
The sudden appearance of this letter

518
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,740
is highly suspicious.

519
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:55,830
Today is your eldest brother's funeral.

520
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:58,840
We must not lose our manners.

521
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:00,650
Come down first.

522
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,520
To my dear brother Zhenglun.

523
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:10,670
Mother has been ill at the estate
for a long time.

524
00:27:11,350 --> 00:27:12,310
The doctor said

525
00:27:12,790 --> 00:27:14,390
her condition is incurable.

526
00:27:14,550 --> 00:27:15,200
Zhengjun!

527
00:27:15,830 --> 00:27:17,200
This is the mourning hall.

528
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,720
We cannot afford any complications.

529
00:27:18,720 --> 00:27:19,450
Listen to me.

530
00:27:19,830 --> 00:27:20,430
Come down.

531
00:27:23,790 --> 00:27:24,480
Father.

532
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:27,200
Master.

533
00:27:28,790 --> 00:27:30,120
This is a family letter,

534
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:31,950
not his last words.

535
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:34,920
It is not suitable to be read here.

536
00:27:39,270 --> 00:27:40,310
My wife is right.

537
00:27:40,750 --> 00:27:42,340
This is a family letter.

538
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:44,550
Don't read it in public.

539
00:27:45,030 --> 00:27:45,720
Come down.

540
00:27:46,550 --> 00:27:48,640
Mother probably doesn't have
much time left.

541
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:49,240
Zhengjun!

542
00:27:49,350 --> 00:27:50,590
She resents you in the end

543
00:27:50,590 --> 00:27:51,830
for abandoning her
while she's seriously ill

544
00:27:51,830 --> 00:27:53,510
to go to the battlefield.

545
00:27:53,510 --> 00:27:55,920
You sacrificed your family
for the greater good.

546
00:27:55,920 --> 00:27:57,500
You failed to repay her,

547
00:27:57,590 --> 00:27:59,050
which makes you unfilial.

548
00:27:59,270 --> 00:28:00,930
As Mother lay on her deathbed,

549
00:28:01,240 --> 00:28:03,480
I hope for your swift victory and return.

550
00:28:03,480 --> 00:28:05,750
If she cannot see you one last time,

551
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,770
I fear she will not rest in peace

552
00:28:08,070 --> 00:28:10,000
and will die with resentment.

553
00:28:12,750 --> 00:28:13,590
This is...

554
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:15,270
A huge taboo on the battlefield.

555
00:28:15,270 --> 00:28:16,070
That's right.

556
00:28:16,510 --> 00:28:18,640
The slightest negligence can cost a life.

557
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:20,510
That's why letters to the border

558
00:28:20,510 --> 00:28:22,200
have always reported only good news.

559
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:23,790
Who would write such a letter
to the frontline?

560
00:28:23,790 --> 00:28:24,480
Exactly.

561
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,680
In that case,

562
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,440
Zhenglun must have died in battle

563
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:29,310
because he was eager to finish things

564
00:28:29,310 --> 00:28:31,750
and rush back to see his mother
one last time.

565
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:32,610
Makes sense.

566
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:33,400
Makes sense.

567
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,400
That makes sense.

568
00:28:38,750 --> 00:28:39,440
Zhengjun.

569
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,700
Who wrote this letter?

570
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:45,790
Respectfully yours,

571
00:28:45,790 --> 00:28:47,320
younger brother Zhengjun.

572
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:52,410
It wasn't me.

573
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:54,590
It wasn't me!

574
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:55,750
I clearly...

575
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,830
I clearly wrote,

576
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,540
"Mother is in good health,

577
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:01,200
and I am studying diligently

578
00:29:01,200 --> 00:29:02,440
without slacking off."

579
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,570
How did this happen?

580
00:29:03,590 --> 00:29:04,590
Fourth Sister,

581
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,930
we wrote this letter together.

582
00:29:07,310 --> 00:29:08,590
How did this happen?

583
00:29:12,110 --> 00:29:12,900
I'm afraid

584
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,730
the letter was swapped.

585
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:18,240
You're right.

586
00:29:19,030 --> 00:29:21,160
Someone must have swapped the letter.

587
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,160
Someone must have!

588
00:29:22,160 --> 00:29:22,750
Father.

589
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:24,000
Grandmother.

590
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:25,690
My brother was murdered.

591
00:29:25,760 --> 00:29:27,570
He was killed by this letter!

592
00:29:29,830 --> 00:29:30,590
Shu.

593
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:31,240
Here.

594
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:36,520
Let's finish the funeral first.

595
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:37,780
As for this matter,

596
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:40,260
we will discuss it when we go back.

597
00:29:43,070 --> 00:29:43,680
Yes.

598
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:46,320
Come down.

599
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,200
No!

600
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:50,200
I must clarify it here.

601
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,070
Second Brother,

602
00:29:52,070 --> 00:29:54,200
who did you give the letter to that day?

603
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:05,930
Tell me.

604
00:30:06,470 --> 00:30:09,270
Where did you take the letter
after I passed it to you?

605
00:30:09,270 --> 00:30:10,480
I...

606
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:11,400
Speak!

607
00:30:11,790 --> 00:30:12,640
Yes.

608
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:15,940
The Second Young Master
indeed gave it to me.

609
00:30:32,790 --> 00:30:33,400
Yes,

610
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,660
I was the one who sent Nanny Liu

611
00:30:35,830 --> 00:30:36,890
to take the letter.

612
00:30:37,350 --> 00:30:38,560
I wanted to help

613
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:39,810
send it out quickly.

614
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,260
But after Nanny Liu

615
00:30:41,590 --> 00:30:43,060
got the letter,

616
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:43,980
the rain

617
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,990
had completely soaked it.

618
00:30:46,540 --> 00:30:48,270
Not a single word could be read.

619
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:49,540
I guessed

620
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:52,160
Zhengjun must have wanted
to report the family affairs

621
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,110
to Zhenglun,

622
00:30:53,550 --> 00:30:56,160
so I had someone draft one.

623
00:30:59,160 --> 00:31:00,720
I meant well.

624
00:31:00,830 --> 00:31:01,590
You...

625
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:03,400
You meant well?

626
00:31:04,270 --> 00:31:06,750
If you meant well, you should have
said it clearly to my face!

627
00:31:06,750 --> 00:31:07,410
I really...

628
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:09,240
I didn't expect the Head Madam
of the Xie family

629
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:10,840
to do something like this.

630
00:31:11,110 --> 00:31:14,040
It's no different from
murdering a concubine's son.

631
00:31:14,080 --> 00:31:15,110
Keep your voice down.

632
00:31:15,110 --> 00:31:16,510
Don't talk nonsense!

633
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:19,100
What Mother said is also true.

634
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:22,030
At that time, Mei Yinghua
was about to die.

635
00:31:22,550 --> 00:31:23,270
Mother

636
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:25,440
definitely didn't do it on purpose.

637
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:26,030
Father,

638
00:31:26,510 --> 00:31:27,680
there must be something wrong
with this matter.

639
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:29,940
Don't be provoked by false accusations.

640
00:31:37,510 --> 00:31:38,030
Father,

641
00:31:38,750 --> 00:31:40,270
my brother hasn't been buried yet.

642
00:31:40,270 --> 00:31:42,330
This matter can't just end like this.

643
00:31:50,110 --> 00:31:50,790
Father,

644
00:31:51,350 --> 00:31:52,240
Zhenglun

645
00:31:52,550 --> 00:31:54,880
was not only the eldest son
of the Xie family

646
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:57,090
and our respected eldest brother,

647
00:31:57,350 --> 00:31:58,510
but also a loyal martyr

648
00:31:58,510 --> 00:32:00,420
known to everyone in Hengtang.

649
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:02,920
This is not as simple as a family affair.

650
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:07,280
The people who came today

651
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:09,420
are all distinguished guests.

652
00:32:09,550 --> 00:32:11,610
If we don't give them an explanation,

653
00:32:11,750 --> 00:32:14,310
how can we demonstrate
the righteousness of our Xie family?

654
00:32:14,310 --> 00:32:16,110
How will we convince the public?

655
00:32:16,270 --> 00:32:17,030
Father.

656
00:32:20,270 --> 00:32:21,350
Eldest Lady is right.

657
00:32:21,350 --> 00:32:23,750
A loyal and heroic soul has died,

658
00:32:23,750 --> 00:32:25,270
yet the cause of death is suspicious.

659
00:32:25,270 --> 00:32:26,680
If it's not thoroughly investigated,

660
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,410
how can we possibly sit idly by?

661
00:32:28,510 --> 00:32:30,070
Indeed!

662
00:32:30,070 --> 00:32:30,830
Mother,

663
00:32:31,070 --> 00:32:32,790
you have known me for decades.

664
00:32:32,790 --> 00:32:34,160
You know very well

665
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:35,700
how I treat the Xie family.

666
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,520
I am a daughter

667
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:39,830
of the prominent Hu family.

668
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:41,030
You also know

669
00:32:41,030 --> 00:32:42,490
what my character is like.

670
00:32:43,110 --> 00:32:45,110
Old Madam, please discern the truth

671
00:32:45,270 --> 00:32:46,840
and uphold justice for me.

672
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,280
Mother...

673
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,880
Exactly. How can it not be investigated?

674
00:32:56,880 --> 00:32:57,960
The evidence is here.

675
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,000
How can we not investigate?

676
00:32:59,000 --> 00:32:59,720
Enough!

677
00:33:14,350 --> 00:33:15,200
Everyone.

678
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:17,680
Today's funeral

679
00:33:18,720 --> 00:33:20,480
is to mourn Zhenglun,

680
00:33:20,750 --> 00:33:22,680
who sacrificed his life for the nation.

681
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:24,540
May his heroic soul live forever.

682
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:27,310
If there are hidden circumstances...

683
00:33:27,830 --> 00:33:29,960
after the Xie family investigates it,

684
00:33:30,070 --> 00:33:31,930
we will definitely give everyone

685
00:33:32,110 --> 00:33:33,110
an explanation.

686
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:52,720
Everyone.

687
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:55,310
The general's armor

688
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:57,800
will be placed in the ancestral hall.

689
00:33:58,720 --> 00:33:59,880
When his remains

690
00:34:00,350 --> 00:34:01,720
are brought back in the future,

691
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:03,160
they will be buried together.

692
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,820
Today's matter is concluded.

693
00:34:05,070 --> 00:34:07,000
Please return to your residences.

694
00:34:07,070 --> 00:34:08,070
This...

695
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:12,000
Yes.

696
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:18,280
Lord Shen, Commander of
the Palace Guard, has arrived.

697
00:34:50,670 --> 00:34:51,800
Yan Rui?

698
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,110
It's Yan Rui.

699
00:34:54,480 --> 00:34:55,210
It's Yan Rui.

700
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:57,080
Didn't they say it was Lord Shen?

701
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:02,070
Yan Rui?

702
00:35:02,800 --> 00:35:04,550
How dare he come to the Xie family?

703
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:06,750
And he chose to come during the funeral.

704
00:35:36,710 --> 00:35:38,400
Commander of the Palace Guard,

705
00:35:38,400 --> 00:35:39,410
Shen Run,

706
00:35:39,800 --> 00:35:41,200
here to comfort the heroic spirit.

707
00:35:41,200 --> 00:35:42,370
I apologize for

708
00:35:42,400 --> 00:35:43,730
disturbing your peace.

709
00:35:43,800 --> 00:35:44,660
My dear friend,

710
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:46,010
have a safe journey.

711
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:54,490
The imperial edict is here.

712
00:36:05,670 --> 00:36:07,400
I heard that a family of martyrs

713
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:09,000
will inherit the righteous spirit
of heaven and earth.

714
00:36:07,680 --> 00:36:10,270
[Commander of the Palace Guard,
Shen Run]

715
00:36:09,190 --> 00:36:11,190
As such, Zhenglun of the Xie family

716
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:13,280
was endowed with a resolute posture

717
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,800
and the courage of a defender.

718
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:16,070
Armed and armored,

719
00:36:16,230 --> 00:36:17,670
he sacrificed himself in battle.

720
00:36:17,670 --> 00:36:18,920
He is hereby posthumously awarded

721
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:20,320
the title of
Commandant of Loyalty and Power.

722
00:36:20,320 --> 00:36:22,670
He shall be enshrined
in the Martyrs' Shrine of the prefecture,

723
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:24,880
and bestowed rites in spring and autumn.

724
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:26,670
His family shall be granted
a hundred taels of gold

725
00:36:26,670 --> 00:36:27,930
and fifty bolts of silk

726
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,440
to compensate the kins left behind.

727
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:30,570
His father, Xie Shu,

728
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:32,020
has taught his son well

729
00:36:32,070 --> 00:36:33,510
for instilling loyalty and integrity.

730
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:35,080
He shall be granted
the title of Earl of Zhongyong

731
00:36:35,080 --> 00:36:37,670
and promoted to Grand Officer
of the Secondary First Rank

732
00:36:37,670 --> 00:36:39,630
to commend his family's teachings.

733
00:36:39,630 --> 00:36:42,510
A plaque honoring the loyal Xie family
shall be built to perpetuate

734
00:36:42,510 --> 00:36:44,110
their renown for posterity.

735
00:36:49,070 --> 00:36:50,110
Lord Xie,

736
00:36:52,230 --> 00:36:53,690
please receive the edict.

737
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:55,630
I humbly

738
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:56,860
receive the edict.

739
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:04,360
I, Xie Shu,

740
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:06,810
thank His Majesty for the profound grace.

741
00:37:23,190 --> 00:37:24,050
My dear nephew,

742
00:37:24,630 --> 00:37:25,800
I didn't expect

743
00:37:26,230 --> 00:37:28,030
you to be the son of an old friend.

744
00:37:28,190 --> 00:37:29,280
Your father,

745
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:30,840
Lord Shen Zhibai,

746
00:37:31,030 --> 00:37:33,870
was my best friend.

747
00:37:34,030 --> 00:37:36,510
Do not be in a hurry to exchange
pleasantries with me, Your Lordship.

748
00:37:36,510 --> 00:37:38,670
I have a second edict to read.

749
00:37:44,070 --> 00:37:44,920
Shen Che.

750
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:49,440
In the 39th year of the Jingyu era,

751
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:51,710
Shen Zhibai took office in Hengtang,

752
00:37:52,070 --> 00:37:54,670
and broke the monopoly
of the prominent families.

753
00:37:54,670 --> 00:37:57,510
He found out that they colluded
with the authorities

754
00:37:57,510 --> 00:37:59,400
under the guise of the Green Sprouts Law,

755
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,760
forcing the civilians

756
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,030
into high-interest loans

757
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,550
and turning the imperial court's
benevolent policy

758
00:38:03,550 --> 00:38:04,710
into a vicious law.

759
00:38:04,960 --> 00:38:05,840
From then on,

760
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:09,360
Shen Zhibai cracked down on the collusion
between officials and merchants.

761
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:11,110
For a while, the politics were clean,

762
00:38:11,110 --> 00:38:12,770
and the people lived in peace.

763
00:38:14,030 --> 00:38:14,880
However,

764
00:38:15,480 --> 00:38:16,960
in less than a year,

765
00:38:17,230 --> 00:38:18,920
the prominent families
colluded with the officials,

766
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,550
instigated the merchant guilds,

767
00:38:20,550 --> 00:38:21,800
and united

768
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:24,000
to fabricate serious charges of corruption

769
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,670
against Shen Zhibai,

770
00:38:25,800 --> 00:38:27,550
framing him collectively.

771
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:29,190
Overnight,

772
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:30,670
Shen Zhibai

773
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:33,670
went from a peerlessly honest
and loyal official

774
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:36,240
to a world-shocking

775
00:38:36,400 --> 00:38:38,190
corrupt official in Hengtang.

776
00:38:47,550 --> 00:38:49,810
Back then, the Shen family was executed,

777
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:52,280
and only two children

778
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:55,360
narrowly escaped death.

779
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:56,920
From then on,

780
00:38:57,960 --> 00:39:00,820
they became lonely wandering ghosts
in this world.

781
00:39:09,840 --> 00:39:10,630
I am

782
00:39:11,510 --> 00:39:12,510
Shen Run,

783
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,510
son of Shen Zhibai.

784
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:19,030
By the Emperor's edict,

785
00:39:21,070 --> 00:39:23,070
I am here to clear Shen Zhibai's name

786
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:26,140
and purge the heinous criminals
from back then.

787
00:39:27,110 --> 00:39:28,420
From today on,

788
00:39:28,590 --> 00:39:30,590
regardless of their official rank,

789
00:39:30,670 --> 00:39:32,600
anyone with evidence against them

790
00:39:33,480 --> 00:39:34,540
will be handed over

791
00:39:35,070 --> 00:39:37,590
to the Palace Guards to be punished
according to the law.

792
00:39:37,590 --> 00:39:38,990
Those who disobey orders

793
00:39:39,960 --> 00:39:41,190
or cause trouble

794
00:39:41,840 --> 00:39:43,570
will be executed immediately.

795
00:39:54,150 --> 00:39:55,280
I don't accept this!

796
00:39:56,280 --> 00:39:57,670
What does a case from years ago

797
00:39:57,670 --> 00:39:58,670
have to do with me?

798
00:39:59,110 --> 00:40:00,510
Open your damn eyes.

799
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:05,480
I am the eldest son
of the Lin family in Hengtang!

800
00:40:05,480 --> 00:40:06,230
Do you know

801
00:40:07,070 --> 00:40:08,000
who my father...

802
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,800
Lin Bingcheng.

803
00:40:16,310 --> 00:40:17,870
In the 5th year of Jingxi,

804
00:40:18,190 --> 00:40:20,880
he forcibly seized a civilian woman
and caused her death.

805
00:40:20,880 --> 00:40:22,280
In the 7th year of Jingxi,

806
00:40:22,630 --> 00:40:25,090
he allowed his servants
to commit violence,

807
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:28,280
forcing dozens of farmers
to sell their fertile land.

808
00:40:28,440 --> 00:40:30,040
The evidence is conclusive.

809
00:40:30,590 --> 00:40:31,850
Execute immediately.

810
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:47,630
Shen Run!

811
00:40:48,150 --> 00:40:49,510
You set up a private court

812
00:40:49,510 --> 00:40:50,590
and killed the innocent!

813
00:40:50,590 --> 00:40:51,670
I will go to the Emperor

814
00:40:51,670 --> 00:40:52,590
and report you!

815
00:40:53,880 --> 00:40:55,320
I almost forgot.

816
00:40:55,630 --> 00:40:57,230
You also allowed

817
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,730
your servants to commit violence.

818
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:11,880
And you,

819
00:41:12,320 --> 00:41:13,630
Fang Ruike.

820
00:41:16,510 --> 00:41:17,280
Not me.

821
00:41:18,590 --> 00:41:19,510
Really, not me!

822
00:41:24,150 --> 00:41:25,280
Not me!

823
00:41:28,230 --> 00:41:30,260
Lord Xie, save me!
